error[E0107]: [CGP-E037] `Reader` is a provider trait and cannot be a `#[uses]` dependency; a dependency names its consumer trait `CanRead`
  --> src/main.rs:29:8
   |
29 | #[uses(Reader<'static, Text>)]
   |        ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: name the consumer trait instead: `#[uses(CanRead<'static, Text>)]` (not the provider trait `Reader`)

For more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0107`.
